{"suttaId":"thag6.14","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1980,2005],"vripara":"453"},"segments":{"thag6.14:0.4":"Sabbakāmittheragāthā","thag6.14:1.1":"“Dvipādakoyaṃ asuci, duggandho parihīrati [pariharati (ka.)];","thag6.14:1.3":"Nānākuṇapaparipūro, vissavanto tato tato.","thag6.14:2.1":"“Migaṃ nilīnaṃ kūṭena, baḷiseneva ambujaṃ;","thag6.14:2.3":"Vānaraṃ viya lepena, bādhayanti puthujjanaṃ.","thag6.14:3.1":"“Rūpā saddā rasā gandhā, phoṭṭhabbā ca manoramā;","thag6.14:3.3":"Pañca kāmaguṇā ete, itthirūpasmi dissare.","thag6.14:4.1":"“Ye etā upasevanti, rattacittā puthujjanā;","thag6.14:4.3":"Vaḍḍhenti kaṭasiṃ ghoraṃ, ācinanti punabbhavaṃ.","thag6.14:5.1":"“Yo cetā parivajjeti, sappasseva padā siro;","thag6.14:5.3":"Somaṃ visattikaṃ loke, sato samativattati.","thag6.14:6.1":"“Kāmesvādīnavaṃ disvā, nekkhammaṃ daṭṭhu khemato;","thag6.14:6.3":"Nissaṭo sabbakāmehi, patto me āsavakkhayo”ti.","thag6.14:6.5":"… Sabbakāmitthero ….","thag6.14:6.6":"Chakkanipāto niṭṭhito.","thag6.14:7.0":"Tatruddānaṃ –","thag6.14:7.1":"Uruveḷakassapo ca, thero tekicchakāri ca;","thag6.14:7.3":"Mahānāgo ca kullo ca, mālukyo [māluto (sī. ka.), māluṅkyo (syā.)] sappadāsako.","thag6.14:7.5":"Kātiyāno migajālo, jento sumanasavhayo;","thag6.14:7.7":"Nhātamuni brahmadatto, sirimaṇḍo sabbakāmī ca;","thag6.14:7.9":"Gāthāyo caturāsīti, therā cettha catuddasāti."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
